  "What does LLM stand for in the context of SEO?": "LLM stands for Large Language Model. These are advanced artificial intelligence systems trained on vast amounts of text data to understand context, semantics, and human language. In SEO, it refers to optimizing your digital presence so these models can effectively comprehend and cite your content.",
